// Coverage focus filter (passed to every verilate() under VL_COVERAGE).
// Turns coverage instrumentation OFF for the benches, the SerDes stand-in and
// the sibling repositories' sources, so the merged report scopes to this
// repository's synthesizable RTL (rtl/*.sv). Substring globs (leading '*'): the
// stored source paths mix '/' and '' separators, so anchor on fragments, not
// whole directories.
`verilator_config
coverage_off -file "*tb_*"
coverage_off -file "*serdes_top_stub*"
coverage_off -file "*hh-xcku5p-dev*"
coverage_off -file "*hh-uart*"
coverage_off -file "*verilated_std*"
